{"seq":2,"slug":"composability-design","title":"可组合性设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/tool-design-principles/composability-design","wordCount":1064,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"可组合性设计\">可组合性设计</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>可组合性是 Unix 工具生态的生命力源泉。单个工具可能只做一件简单的事，但当它们通过管道、配置和脚本组合起来时，能完成无限复杂的任务。设计一个可组合的工具意味着：你的工具不需要知道它将与什么搭配使用，但它提供的接口让任何搭配都成为可能。这就像乐高积木——每块积木本身很简单，但组合的可能性是无穷的。</p>\n<p>2026 年的可组合性已经超越了传统的文本管道。现代工具需要支持结构化数据交换（JSON Lines）、事件驱动的工作流（webhook/pubsub）、插件系统扩展、以及与 AI Agent 的协作（MCP 协议）。理解这些层次的可组合性，能让你设计出在当今生态中真正&quot;好用&quot;的工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"可组合性的三个层次\">可组合性的三个层次</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Level 1: Stream Composition&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Level 2: Configuration Composition&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Level 3: Plugin/API Composition&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Level 1: Stream Composition\"] --&gt; B[\"Level 2: Configuration Composition\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Level 3: Plugin/API Composition\"]</pre><p><strong>Level 1 — 流式组合</strong>（管道）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>stdin/stdout 数据流</li>\n<li>退出码传递</li>\n<li>信号处理（SIGPIPE）</li>\n<li>代表：grep | sort | uniq</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Level 2 — 配置组合</strong>（声明式）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>配置文件组合多个行为</li>\n<li>环境变量覆盖</li>\n<li>代表：Docker Compose、GitHub Actions</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Level 3 — 插件/API 组合</strong>（编程式）</p>\n<ul>\n<li>插件系统</li>\n<li>库 API（libcurl、libgit2）</li>\n<li>MCP 协议（AI Agent 工具调用）</li>\n<li>代表：VS Code 扩展、Webpack 插件</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"输入输出契约\">输入输出契约</h3><p>可组合的工具必须有清晰的输入输出契约：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"┌─────────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│            Your Tool                 │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│ INPUT:                               │&#10;│   - stdin (text lines / JSON)        │&#10;│   - positional args (files/URLs)     │&#10;│   - flags (--json, --quiet)          │&#10;│   - env vars (TOOL_CONFIG)           │&#10;│   - config file (~/.config/tool/)    │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│ OUTPUT:                              │&#10;│   - stdout (results, structured)     │&#10;│   - stderr (logs, errors, progress)  │&#10;│   - exit code (0=ok, 1=error)        │&#10;│   - files (if explicitly requested)  │&#10;└─────────────────────────────────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>┌─────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│            Your Tool                 │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ INPUT:                               │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   - stdin (text lines / JSON)        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   - positional args (files/URLs)     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   - flags (--json, --quiet)          │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   - env vars (TOOL_CONFIG)           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   - config file (~/.config/tool/)    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ OUTPUT:                              │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   - stdout (results, structured)     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   - stderr (logs, errors, progress)  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   - exit code (0=ok, 1=error)        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   - files (if explicitly requested)  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>核心约定</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据输出永远走 stdout</li>\n<li>人类可读的状态信息走 stderr</li>\n<li>这样 <code>tool1 | tool2</code> 时，tool1 的进度条不会污染 tool2 的输入</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"json-lines-ndjson-现代管道的通用语\">JSON Lines (Ndjson) — 现代管道的通用语</h3><p>传统管道以&quot;行&quot;为单位。现代工具越来越多地使用 JSON Lines 格式——每行一个 JSON 对象：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 输出 JSON Lines&#10;mytool --json-lines &lt;&lt; output:&#10;{&quot;file&quot;: &quot;src/app.ts&quot;, &quot;issues&quot;: 3, &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;warn&quot;}&#10;{&quot;file&quot;: &quot;src/utils.ts&quot;, &quot;issues&quot;: 0, &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;ok&quot;}&#10;{&quot;file&quot;: &quot;src/api.ts&quot;, &quot;issues&quot;: 1, &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;error&quot;}&#10;&#10;# 下游工具可以用 jq 过滤&#10;mytool --json-lines | jq &#39;select(.severity == &quot;error&quot;)&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出 JSON Lines</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mytool</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --json-lines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> output:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{\"file\": \"src/app.ts\", \"issues\": 3, \"severity\": \"warn\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{\"file\": \"src/utils.ts\", \"issues\": 0, \"severity\": \"ok\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{\"file\": \"src/api.ts\", \"issues\": 1, \"severity\": \"error\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"># 下游工具可以用 jq 过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mytool --json-lines | jq 'select(.severity == \"error\")'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>JSON Lines 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流式处理（不需要等全部数据加载）</li>\n<li>结构化（比纯文本更容易解析）</li>\n<li>自描述（字段名即文档）</li>\n<li>容错（一行解析失败不影响其他行）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"设计多格式输出\">设计多格式输出</h3><p>一个好的可组合工具应该支持多种输出格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 人类友好模式（默认，当 stdout 是 TTY 时）&#10;$ disk-usage ~/projects&#10;  12.0 GB  node_modules/&#10;   4.7 GB  .git/&#10;   2.1 GB  dist/&#10;&#10;# 机器友好模式&#10;$ disk-usage ~/projects --json&#10;[&#10;  {&quot;path&quot;: &quot;node_modules/&quot;, &quot;bytes&quot;: 12884901888},&#10;  {&quot;path&quot;: &quot;.git/&quot;, &quot;bytes&quot;: 5046586572},&#10;  {&quot;path&quot;: &quot;dist/&quot;, &quot;bytes&quot;: 2254857830}&#10;]&#10;&#10;# Tab 分隔（方便 awk/cut 处理）&#10;$ disk-usage ~/projects --tsv&#10;12884901888\tnode_modules/&#10;5046586572\t.git/&#10;2254857830\tdist/&#10;&#10;# 单值模式（方便嵌入脚本）&#10;$ disk-usage ~/projects --total --bytes&#10;20506334002\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 人类友好模式（默认，当 stdout 是 TTY 时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> disk-usage</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/projects</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  12.0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GB</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  node_modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">   4.7</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GB</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  .git/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">   2.1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GB</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  dist/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 机器友好模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> disk-usage</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/projects</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node_modules/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12884901888</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".git/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5046586572</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2254857830</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Tab 分隔（方便 awk/cut 处理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> disk-usage</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/projects</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tsv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">12884901888</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\tnode_modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">5046586572</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\t.git/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">2254857830</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\tdist/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 单值模式（方便嵌入脚本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> disk-usage</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/projects</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --total</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">20506334002</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实现模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function formatOutput(data, options) {&#10;  if (options.json) return JSON.stringify(data);&#10;  if (options.tsv) return data.map((d) =&gt; `${d.bytes}\\t${d.path}`).join(&#39;\\n&#39;);&#10;  if (!process.stdout.isTTY) return formatPlain(data); // 管道时自动简化&#10;  return formatHuman(data); // TTY 时带颜色和对齐&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatOutput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (options.json) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (options.tsv) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bytes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">process.stdout.isTTY) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatPlain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 管道时自动简化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatHuman</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TTY 时带颜色和对齐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实现标准信号处理\">实现标准信号处理</h3><p>可组合的工具必须正确处理 Unix 信号：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// SIGPIPE: 下游管道关闭时优雅退出（不报错）&#10;process.on(&#39;SIGPIPE&#39;, () =&gt; process.exit(0));&#10;&#10;// SIGINT (Ctrl-C): 清理并退出&#10;process.on(&#39;SIGINT&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  cleanup();&#10;  process.exit(130); // 128 + signal number&#10;});&#10;&#10;// SIGTERM: 优雅关闭&#10;process.on(&#39;SIGTERM&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  cleanup();&#10;  process.exit(143);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SIGPIPE: 下游管道关闭时优雅退出（不报错）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SIGPIPE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SIGINT (Ctrl-C): 清理并退出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SIGINT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cleanup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">130</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 128 + signal number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SIGTERM: 优雅关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SIGTERM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cleanup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">143</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>忽略 SIGPIPE 是新手最常犯的错误——当用户执行 <code>your-tool | head -5</code> 时，head 读完 5 行后关闭管道，如果你的工具不处理 SIGPIPE，就会抛出一个丑陋的错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配置优先级设计\">配置优先级设计</h3><p>可组合的工具应该接受来自多个来源的配置，并有清晰的优先级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"优先级（从高到低）：&#10;1. 命令行参数        --output=json&#10;2. 环境变量          TOOL_OUTPUT=json&#10;3. 项目配置文件      ./.toolrc.json&#10;4. 用户配置文件      ~/.config/tool/config.json&#10;5. 系统配置          /etc/tool/config.json&#10;6. 内置默认值        output: &quot;human&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>优先级（从高到低）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 命令行参数        --output=json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 环境变量          TOOL_OUTPUT=json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 项目配置文件      ./.toolrc.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 用户配置文件      ~/.config/tool/config.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 系统配置          /etc/tool/config.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>6. 内置默认值        output: \"human\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这让工具在不同场景下都能正确工作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>个人使用时：修改用户配置文件</li>\n<li>项目范围：提交 .toolrc.json 到仓库</li>\n<li>CI 环境：通过环境变量覆盖</li>\n<li>临时调整：命令行参数</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"成为好的管道公民\">成为好的管道公民</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 检测是否在管道中（stdin 不是 TTY）&#10;if [ ! -t 0 ]; then&#10;  # 在管道中：从 stdin 读取&#10;  INPUT=$(cat)&#10;else&#10;  # 交互模式：使用参数或提示用户&#10;  INPUT=&quot;$1&quot;&#10;fi&#10;&#10;# 检测 stdout 是否被管道（输出不是 TTY）&#10;if [ ! -t 1 ]; then&#10;  # 输出被管道：简化格式，去除颜色&#10;  echo &quot;$RESULT&quot;&#10;else&#10;  # 输出到终端：带颜色和格式&#10;  echo -e &quot;\\033[32m$RESULT\\033[0m&quot;&#10;fi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检测是否在管道中（stdin 不是 TTY）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 在管道中：从 stdin 读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  INPUT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 交互模式：使用参数或提示用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  INPUT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检测 stdout 是否被管道（输出不是 TTY）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 输出被管道：简化格式，去除颜色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$RESULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 输出到终端：带颜色和格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\\033[32m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$RESULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\033[0m\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"no_color-标准\">NO_COLOR 标准</h3><p>尊重 <code>NO_COLOR</code> 环境变量（<a href=\"https://no-color.org/）：\">https://no-color.org/）：</a></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const useColor = process.stdout.isTTY &amp;&amp; !process.env.NO_COLOR &amp;&amp; process.env.TERM !== &#39;dumb&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> useColor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.stdout.isTTY </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NO_COLOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TERM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dumb'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"渐进增强而非全有全无\">渐进增强而非全有全无</h3><p>不要让缺少某个功能的支持导致整个工具失败：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 不好：json 解析失败就整个崩溃&#10;const data = JSON.parse(input); // throws on invalid JSON&#10;&#10;// 好：优雅降级&#10;try {&#10;  const data = JSON.parse(input);&#10;  return processStructured(data);&#10;} catch {&#10;  // 如果不是 JSON，当作纯文本处理&#10;  return processPlainText(input);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不好：json 解析失败就整个崩溃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// throws on invalid JSON</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 好：优雅降级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processStructured</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 如果不是 JSON，当作纯文本处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processPlainText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"可组合性设计模式库\">可组合性设计模式库</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>代表实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Filter</td>\n<td>从输入中筛选子集</td>\n<td>grep, jq select</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Map</td>\n<td>转换每个输入项</td>\n<td>sed, jq map</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reduce</td>\n<td>聚合输入为单一结果</td>\n<td>wc, jq reduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tee</td>\n<td>分流输出到多个目标</td>\n<td>tee</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiplex</td>\n<td>合并多个输入流</td>\n<td>paste</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"2026-年的新组合模式\">2026 年的新组合模式</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>MCP (Model Context Protocol)</strong> — AI Agent 调用工具的标准协议</li>\n<li><strong>Webhook 组合</strong> — 工具间通过 HTTP 事件通信</li>\n<li><strong>WASI 组合</strong> — WebAssembly 模块作为可组合的计算单元</li>\n<li><strong>nushell 管道</strong> — 结构化对象流替代文本流</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>可组合性是工具长期生命力的关键。一个不可组合的工具是一座孤岛；一个可组合的工具是生态系统的一部分。</p>\n<p>设计可组合工具的核心原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据走 stdout，状态走 stderr——永远不要混淆</li>\n<li>支持多格式输出（human/json/tsv）——让人和机器都能消费</li>\n<li>正确处理信号——做一个好的管道公民</li>\n<li>配置有明确优先级——命令行 &gt; 环境变量 &gt; 配置文件 &gt; 默认值</li>\n<li>优雅降级——处理不了的输入格式回退而非崩溃</li>\n<li>尊重 NO_COLOR 和 TTY 检测——在不同环境下自适应</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可组合性设计","id":"可组合性设计"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"可组合性的三个层次","id":"可组合性的三个层次"},{"level":3,"text":"输入输出契约","id":"输入输出契约"},{"level":3,"text":"JSON Lines (Ndjson) — 现代管道的通用语","id":"json-lines-ndjson-现代管道的通用语"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"设计多格式输出","id":"设计多格式输出"},{"level":3,"text":"实现标准信号处理","id":"实现标准信号处理"},{"level":3,"text":"配置优先级设计","id":"配置优先级设计"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"成为好的管道公民","id":"成为好的管道公民"},{"level":3,"text":"NO_COLOR 标准","id":"no_color-标准"},{"level":3,"text":"渐进增强而非全有全无","id":"渐进增强而非全有全无"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"可组合性设计模式库","id":"可组合性设计模式库"},{"level":3,"text":"2026 年的新组合模式","id":"2026-年的新组合模式"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"Unix 哲学应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/tool-design-principles/unix-philosophy-applied"},"next":{"title":"人机工程学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/tool-design-principles/developer-ergonomics"}}